  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5d8548505a2c5104980a6fa13739ca3d, type: 3}
  m_Name: ShotDarkness
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _name: Shot by darkness
  _description: Terafine charges the arrow with dark energy before firing, which
    causes an additional 5-8 points of damage with "Darkness" magic, the speed of
    the shot is reduced by 30%. The magic effect "Inner Darkness" is applied to the
    victim for 13 seconds, with each new overlay, the duration of the effect decreases,
    it is applied up to 13 times. When the victim has accumulated 13 units of "Inner
    Darkness", she succumbs to the magical effect of "Fear"  "Inner Darkness" - Extends
    the time of magical effects applied by Terafine and ghosts by 30% Each subsequent
    overlay increases the time by an additional 2%.  "Fear" - "The darkness that
    has entered the soul begins to violently torment it and each time this rage increases,
    but the stronger the inner darkness, the faster the victim will be able to free
    himself from it"
  _icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 938620e654f6d2d47a71a99689361b9c, type: 3}
